# SYSTEM ROLE

The Monitoring subsystem functions as the nervous system of the LEGAiSEE CommandCenter.

It continuously observes the state of all components and translates system activity into structured awareness.

Without monitoring, the system operates blindly.

With monitoring, the system becomes observable, diagnosable, and controllable.

---

# GUIDING PRINCIPLE

> **What cannot be observed cannot be controlled.
> What cannot be measured cannot be improved.
> Monitoring turns system behavior into operational intelligence.**

